            <title>[ZEPPELIN-4081] when the python process is killed,the task state is still running</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-4081</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;when execute the following python code, then kill the&#160;python process,the taks state is still running&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
